# ============================================================
# MedOrbits -- Git Attributes
# File: .gitattributes
# Release target: 3.0.0
#
# Purpose:
# - Normalize text files to LF line endings.
# - Preserve binary assets without text conversion.
# - Keep source, configuration, and lockfiles diffable.
# - Configure GitHub language statistics for generated content.
# - Improve cross-platform collaboration and release consistency.
#
# Policy:
# - Keep rules narrow and predictable.
# - Never mark source code as binary.
# - Do not suppress meaningful diffs for security-sensitive files.
# - Review path-specific rules before adding them.
# ============================================================


